    "derivation": "Every column of ngspice-44.2's SP Analysis plot at all five points, read from its binary raw by name. The node columns are the solution of its last port drive (span.c:825, cktspdum.c:146-149): v(v2#res) = 1, v(v1#res) = 0. Its Y and Z equal F^-1 (E + S)^-1 (E - S) F^-1 and F (E - S)^-1 (E + S) F, F = diag(sqrt z0), on its own S to 7e-16 relative (checked by hand). The deck is linear with an all-zero operating point, so each number is one complex LU solve, exact to rounding.",
